  <strong><%= @ride.on.strftime("%A, %B %-d") %></strong><br>
  Gather <%= @ride.gathers_at %>, ride <%= @ride.rides_at %>.
</p>

<p>
  Sunken Gardens Park, in front of West High School on Elati St.
</p>

<h2>Start here</h2>

<p>
  We gather in the street, there are some announcements, then we ride together at a party pace. Bring lights, water, and
  whatever wheels help you move comfortably. The ride is typically 14 miles, 8&ndash;12mph, and always ends at the
  meeting spot.
</p>

